  "_doc": "#1553 TABLE 1 — Cloud-scope folder HIERARCHY for Configs ▸ Launcher ▸ Folders. Sections (groups) → folders. Served by the fleet-data client (Cloud Store provider, tier 3), read at runtime, NEVER baked into an APK. Each row: section, id, label, icon, order. The special 'others' folder is synthesised at runtime and is never declared here. A folder may be declared even when no cloud app maps to it yet — the taxonomy is the complete category map; empty folders simply do not render in the grid until an app lands in them. Edit this file to reorganise; no cloud app is ever removed from the fleet by a change here. #1902/#1916: the nine sections are the Quickmarks sections in their order (Data, Communication, Primary, Me, Services · City, Services · Leisure, AGI, Setup, Projects); every folder and id is unchanged, only the section and the order moved (Drive, Browser and Wallet moved Primary to Data; test-launcher-surfaces-parity-1902.sh, test-group-glyphs-1916.sh).",
